  triage:title "BA.2 doc says Start resets reminder_count; code preserves it, and the doc-named test was renamed" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. BA.2 doc says Start resets reminder_count; code preserves it, and the doc-named test was renamed. Doc says: sprint-BA.2 specifies Start sets `reminder_count = 0` alongside `lead_notified_count = 0`, and AC2 asserts 'Every test above exists by name'. Code does: `UPDATE tasks SET state=?3, lead_notified_count=0, updated_at=?4 WHERE team=?1 AND task_id=?2` — reminder_count is preserved (commit fa32b1cbb), and the doc-named test was renamed to `..._preserves_reminder_count`. Recommendation: Amend sprint-BA.2 to match the shipped semantics and re-state AC2, or record the rename explicitly." ;
